-- title:
--   Index Hadamards preserve certificate-dependent workspace fibers
-- statement:
--   Fix a G₂ verifier V and any workspace assignment s(c) depending only on the certificate claim c. Let K_s be the associated basis-embedding matrix, let H_phys be the literal paired-Hadamard bank on the index wires, and let H_log act by the index Hadamard matrix on the logical computation registers. Then
--
--   $$
--   H_{\mathrm{phys}}K_s=K_sH_{\mathrm{log}}.
--   $$
--
--   No cleanliness or certificate-validity hypothesis is needed. Dependence of s on the certificate alone ensures that every index superposition uses the same workspace within a claim sector.
